    "body": "I wonder if we need to consider backward compatibility here? Since the major user is a few test cases in [Web Bluetooth BIDI](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/bluetooth/bidi/), which have already been broken when https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth/pull/646 was merged (Chrome Bidi driver has bot to crawl spec change hence Chrome Bidi driver [updated](https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/chromium-bidi/pull/3140) and broke tests). \r\n\r\nSo I thought we just move forward to fix those with without considering backward compatibility.",
    "created_at": "2025-03-05T21:25:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-05T21:26:12Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/bluetooth/pull/648#discussion_r1982206546",
